so balance your skin’s pH, soothe irritation, and leave a subtle floral scent that uplifts your mood.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0_I0iVQWl_text","label":"gg0_I0iVQWl_text","default":"<p>Absolutely! It works great as a makeup setting spray to keep your look fresh and dewy while adding extra hydration without smudging your makeup.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4oST9URdT_text","label":"gg4oST9URdT_text","default":"<p>Feel free to use it as often as you like — whether to cool down, refresh your skin, or add a gentle burst of hydration anytime your skin feels dry or tired.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQRItR6dDy_text","label":"ggQRItR6dDy_text","default":"<p>No, the mist is lightweight and absorbs quickly, leaving your skin feeling soft, fresh, and never sticky or greasy.</p>"}],
